<title>USA: PCX to trade LEAPS on Xilinx from June 13.</title>
<headline>PCX to trade LEAPS on Xilinx from June 13.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Exchange said Wednesday it will begin trading LEAPS (Long Term Equity Anticipation Securities) on shares of Xilinx Inc on June 13.</p>
<p>The exchange said the LEAPS will expire in January 1999 and have initial strike prices of 35, 45 and 55.</p>
<p>Xilinx shares were down 2-1/16 at 45 Wednesday afternoon.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
